Subject: drm_ras_genl_family: Add DRM RAS module information

drm_ras is built as a standalone backport module. Add the required module
information to the DRM RAS Generic Netlink source so modpost can process
drm_ras.ko.

Signed-off-by: Kanaka Raju Nayana <kanaka.raju.nayana@intel.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ras_genl_family.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ras_genl_family.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ras_genl_family.c
index 6f406d3..7e4cd7a 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ras_genl_family.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ras_genl_family.c
@@ -40,3 +40,7 @@ void drm_ras_genl_family_unregister(void)
 		registered = false;
 	}
 }
+
+MODULE_LICENSE("Dual MIT/GPL");
+MODULE_DESCRIPTION("DRM RAS (Reliability, Availability, Serviceability) framework");
+MODULE_AUTHOR("Intel Corporation");
